          "type": "Index"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Derived&",
      "docs": "Multiplies *this by the transposition \\f$(ij)\\f$ on the left.\n\\returns a reference to *this.\n\\warning This is much slower than applyTranspositionOnTheRight(Index,Index):\nthis has linear complexity and requires a lot of branching.\n\\sa applyTranspositionOnTheRight(Index,Index)"
    },
    {
