    {
      "id": "permutation-matrix-b06e35",
      "name": "PermutationMatrix",
      "category": "PermutationMatrix",
      "signature": "PermutationMatrix()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "\\class PermutationMatrix\n\\ingroup Core_Module\n\\brief Permutation matrix\n\\tparam SizeAtCompileTime the number of rows/cols, or Dynamic\n\\tparam MaxSizeAtCompileTime the maximum number of rows/cols, or Dynamic. This optional parameter defaults to SizeAtCompileTime. Most of the time, you should not have to specify it.\n\\tparam _StorageIndex the integer type of the indices\nThis class represents a permutation matrix, internally stored as a vector of integers.\n\\sa class PermutationBase, class PermutationWrapper, class DiagonalMatrix"
    },
